            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-brand-emerald opacity-75 animate-ping"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-emerald"></span>
          </span>
          <span>Live in 14 dagen</span>
        </span>
